        <item>
            <title><![CDATA[Release 1.6.0 - PREMIUM]]></title>
            <link>https://andreadada.github.io/dadadocu/dadagraves-changelog/release_1.6.0</link>
            <guid>https://andreadada.github.io/dadadocu/dadagraves-changelog/release_1.6.0</guid>
            <pubDate>Fri, 05 Jun 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate>
            <description><![CDATA[Newest version compatibility]]></description>
            <content:encoded><![CDATA[<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="newest-version-compatibility">Newest version compatibility<a href="https://andreadada.github.io/dadadocu/dadagraves-changelog/release_1.6.0#newest-version-compatibility" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Newest version compatibility" title="Direct link to Newest version compatibility">​</a></h3>
<ul>
<li>Added support up to Minecraft 26.1.2.</li>
</ul>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="commands">Commands<a href="https://andreadada.github.io/dadadocu/dadagraves-changelog/release_1.6.0#commands" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Commands" title="Direct link to Commands">​</a></h3>
<ul>
<li>Added <code>/graves graveyard set</code>.</li>
<li>Added <code>/graves graveyard tp</code>.</li>
<li>Added tab completion for the new graveyard commands.</li>
</ul>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="graveyard">Graveyard<a href="https://andreadada.github.io/dadadocu/dadagraves-changelog/release_1.6.0#graveyard" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Graveyard" title="Direct link to Graveyard">​</a></h3>
<ul>
<li>Added the graveyard system.</li>
<li>When a player respawns after dying, they are teleported to the graveyard if one has been configured.</li>
<li>If no graveyard is configured, DadaGraves does not change the player's respawn location.</li>
</ul>
<h3 class="anchor anchorWithStickyNavbar_LWe7" id="holograms">Holograms<a href="https://andreadada.github.io/dadadocu/dadagraves-changelog/release_1.6.0#holograms" class="hash-link" aria-label="Direct link to Holograms" title="Direct link to Holograms">​</a></h3>
<ul>
<li>Improved hologram cleanup when a gravestone is removed.</li>
<li>Removed hologram leftovers more reliably when a grave expires or is deleted.</li>
</ul>]]></content:encoded>
